      ],
      "text": {
        "hi": "‘कर सकता हूँ / कर सकती हूँ’ = can. I can swim = मैं तैर सकता हूँ / सकती हूँ।",
        "hinglish": "‘Kar sakta hoon / kar sakti hoon’ = can. I can swim = Main tair sakta hoon / sakti hoon.",
        "en": "Use ‘can’ for things you are able to do: I can swim."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "learn_card",
      "id": "L3.U08.S02",
      "skills": [
        "grammar.can"
      ],
      "text": {
        "hi": "अच्छी बात: ‘can’ कभी नहीं बदलता — I can, he can, she can. और ‘can’ के बाद काम वाला शब्द सीधा आता है: can run.",
        "hinglish": "Achhi baat: ‘can’ kabhi nahi badalta — I can, he can, she can. Aur ‘can’ ke baad kaam waala shabd seedha aata hai: can run.",
        "en": "Good news: ‘can’ never changes — I can, he can, she can. And the action word comes straight after it: can run."
      }
    },
